            "reviewBody": "My wife and I really liked this salad. This was the first time I’ve used a mango in a recipe - thank goodness for YouTubes on how to peel and dice a mango. The only thing I changed was that I used feta cheese instead of goat cheese, because my wife prefers it (and we had it on hand). I’m sure this changed the taste, but it still tasted good. Great spring and summer recipe and pretty easy to put together even for a kitchen klutz like me.",
